# Hardened sshd_config for the LendWise lab host (Task 3)
# Key changes from Ubuntu defaults are commented.

Port 22
Protocol 2

# --- Key-only authentication (deliverable requirement) ---
PasswordAuthentication no
PubkeyAuthentication yes
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
ChallengeResponseAuthentication no
PermitEmptyPasswords no

# --- No direct root login ---
PermitRootLogin no

# --- Only the intended admin user may connect ---
AllowUsers labadmin

# --- Reduce attack surface further ---
X11Forwarding no
AllowTcpForwarding no
PermitTunnel no
MaxAuthTries 3
LoginGraceTime 30
ClientAliveInterval 300
ClientAliveCountMax 2

UsePAM yes
Subsystem sftp /usr/lib/openssh/sftp-server
